# DTF tier manifest: api-contracts-1120
#   (artifact-keeper 1.12.0 API contracts: #4839, #2024 match.format)
# Profile-set: filesystem only. Sibling of api-contracts-1110: pure API
# contracts added in 1.12.0 that nothing else asserts.
#
# RED image: ak-backend:1.11.5. GREEN: an image carrying the 1.12.0 changes.
#
# CONTROLS (pass on every image)
#   an anonymous and an authenticated download of one public generic artifact
#     are both listed by GET /api/v1/admin/downloads?artifact_id=..., one with
#     a null user_id and one with the admin's
#   a lifecycle policy without match.format previews the repository's
#     artifacts; one naming an unknown format, or a misspelt match key, is 400
#
# FIX CASES (RED on 1.11.5)
#   #4839 downloader=anonymous lists only the null-user row,
#     downloader=authenticated only the admin's row, on the listing and on
#     /downloads/by-ip/{ip}; downloader=anonymous with user_id is 400; an
#     unknown downloader value is 400. 1.11.5: the parameter is ignored (both
#     rows, 200).
#   #2024 a policy with match.format "generic" is created and previews the
#     generic repository's artifacts; with match.format "npm" (or ["npm",
#     "helm"]) it previews nothing in that repository. 1.11.5: create is 400
#     ("unknown key 'match.format'").
#
# RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=false: many quick API calls.
PROFILES="storage.filesystem"
ORACLE="oracle.sh"
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED="false"
